Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.21,Cap,,0,0,0,,Your search box can throw the old search out!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.21,0:00:06.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,Tap the gold cross, and every letter jumps out of the box.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.94,0:00:10.35,Cap,,0,0,0,,The field empties, and the cursor waits for the next word.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.35,0:00:13.70,Cap,,0,0,0,,Type dumplings, and the menu filters as you go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.70,0:00:15.34,Cap,,0,0,0,,Escape clears it too.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.34,0:00:18.90,Cap,,0,0,0,,Grab the free code at vaelolab.com/lab.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.90,0:00:21.84,Cap,,0,0,0,,Send this to the café owner with a long lunch menu!
